think-cell: `tc_slots(key)`, `import_elements(slide, key, box, texts)` — p. ej. `d.import_elements(s, "tc:13", box=(0.575,1.5,12.3,5.1), texts={0: ["Diligence", "Weeks 1-4", "..."]})`.
